title: An Opposition Platform
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_opposition_timer <= 0 and time >= 3
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_opposition_timer = 6;
Q.month_actions += 1;
// the strongest current that does not hold the Zentrale
var opp = null;
for (var f of Q.factions) {
    if (f != Q.leading_faction && !Q[f + '_gone'] && (opp === null || Q[f + '_strength'] > Q[opp + '_strength'])) {
        opp = f;
    }
}
Q.c_opp_is_rival = opp ? 1 : 0;
if (opp === null) {
    opp = Q.leading_faction;
}
Q.c_opp_faction = opp;
Q.c_opp_faction_name = Q.faction_names[opp];
Q.c_opp_junior = (Q.junior_faction == opp) ? 1 : 0;
// the signatory the Zentrale could expel: a free comrade of that current whose
// fate the period events do not decide
var keep = ['luxemburg', 'liebknecht', 'jogiches', 'levi', 'levine', 'radek', 'hoelz', 'thalmann', 'brandler', 'fischer'];
var cs = (Q.comrades || []).filter(function (c) {
    return c.status == 'free' && c.faction == opp && keep.indexOf(c.id) < 0;
});
Q.c_opp_leader = cs.length ? RG.pick(cs).id : 0;
Q.c_opp_leader_name = Q.c_opp_leader ? RG.comradeName(Q.c_opp_leader) : 0;
!}
frequency: 200
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= An Opposition Platform

Forty functionaries of the **[+ c_opp_faction_name +]** have signed a platform against the Zentrale and sent it to every district. [? if c_opp_leader_name : The first signature is [+ c_opp_leader_name +]'s. ?] It accuses the Zentrale of ignoring the last congress and of hiding the accounts. Half of it is unfair. The other half is being read aloud at district meetings.

- @debate: Open a party discussion.
- @concede: Give the opposition seats in the Zentrale.
- @expel: Expel [+ c_opp_leader_name +].
- @easy_discard

@debate
subtitle: The [+ c_opp_faction_name +] have their say. The quarrel goes on.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.c_opp_faction + '_satisfaction'] += 8;
Q.unity -= 2;
!}

For a month the party argues with itself in public. At the end most of the signatories are still in the party, and still signatories.

@concede
subtitle: They join the Zentrale as the junior partner, and their red lines become ours to respect.
view-if: c_opp_is_rival = 1
choose-if: c_opp_junior = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ c_opp_faction_name +] already sit in the Zentrale.
on-arrival: {!
Q.junior_faction = Q.c_opp_faction;
Q[Q.c_opp_faction + '_satisfaction'] += 15;
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 8;
Q.unity += 6;
!}

Two of the signatories get seats in the Zentrale and a desk each. They will be harder to silence now, and harder to blame us for.

@expel
subtitle: The Zentrale is obeyed. The [+ c_opp_faction_name +] lose a leader and will not forget it.
view-if: c_opp_leader_name and c_opp_is_rival = 1
on-arrival: {!
var f = Q.c_opp_faction;
RG.expel(Q.c_opp_leader, {news: Q.c_opp_leader_name + ' expelled from the party', priority: 2});
Q[f + '_satisfaction'] -= 15;
Q.unity -= 5;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] == f) {
        Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.94;
    }
}
!}

The Central Committee expels [+ c_opp_leader_name +] for breach of discipline. A protest meeting is held, and then most of those who came to it go home.
